<ProjectLayout slug="opposable-thumb">
  <p>
    Opposable Thumb is a projection mapping installation developed for
    Oberbaumbrücke in Berlin.
  </p>

  <p>
    The work explores movement, architecture and human interaction through
    hand-drawn animation.
  </p>

  <p>
    Created in collaboration with artists working across animation, sound
    design and media art.
  </p>

